{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GyAFtVdkbhnyETAgZE9PcH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a story dated specifically to November 10, 2026, but several recent Taiwan headlines came up:\n\n- **Latest Taiwan news page:** Focus Taiwan, the Central News Agency's English site, is the freshest result. Its headlines include a second batch of F-16V jets arriving, a live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Lai Ching-te promoting Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches. (Taiwan wins 48 golds at Asian Sport Stacking Championships)\n- **Nvidia and Taiwan AI:** Per the Taipei Times front page, a Taiwan Institute of Economic Research president said an Nvidia investigation into CEO Jensen Huang over an alleged affair with a Chinese spy is unlikely to majorly affect Taiwan's AI supply chain. (2026-11-09)\n- **Stock market sell-off:** On November 6, Taiwan ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the market after a global sell-off, and TSMC shares fell as much as 9.8 percent that day.\n- **Legislator indicted:** Prosecutors indicted independent legislator May Chin and three aides on suspicion of receiving Chinese funding to build organizations in Taiwan, seeking 14 years for Chin (November 6).\n- **Other items on Taiwan News (updated about 2 days ago):** A magnitude 4.2 earthquake in central Taiwan, a ban on Chinese-owned yachts under revised entry rules, and Taiwan closing its office in Papua New Guinea.\n\nThe Taipei Times page snapshot is older, so treat its headline timing with some caution. For confirmed November 10 coverage, check Focus Taiwan or Taiwan News directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"061d46d9-42a6-4a7e-8b4e-8c2c6f16682f","uuid":"f4a48856-31fe-4ba1-a7c5-a4a065432659","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:57:31.249Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Taiwan news November 10 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01K9vxV3CBoKnRmhn7A4RDAn","content":[{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News"},{"title":"Front Page - Taipei Times","url":"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front"},{"title":"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World","url":"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/"},{"title":"Taiwan Journal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal"},{"title":"TVBS News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News"},{"title":"Taiwan Daily","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily"},{"title":"TaiwanPlus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan"},{"title":"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News","url":"https://focustaiwan.tw/"}]},"The search didn't turn up a story dated specifically to November 10, 2026, but several recent Taiwan headlines came up:\n\n- **Latest Taiwan news page:** Focus Taiwan, the Central News Agency's English site, is the freshest result. Its headlines include a second batch of F-16V jets arriving, a live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Lai Ching-te promoting Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches. (Taiwan wins 48 golds at Asian Sport Stacking Championships)\n- **Nvidia and Taiwan AI:** Per the Taipei Times front page, a Taiwan Institute of Economic Research president said an Nvidia investigation into CEO Jensen Huang over an alleged affair with a Chinese spy is unlikely to majorly affect Taiwan's AI supply chain. (2026-11-09)\n- **Stock market sell-off:** On November 6, Taiwan ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the market after a global sell-off, and TSMC shares fell as much as 9.8 percent that day.\n- **Legislator indicted:** Prosecutors indicted independent legislator May Chin and three aides on suspicion of receiving Chinese funding to build organizations in Taiwan, seeking 14 years for Chin (November 6).\n- **Other items on Taiwan News (updated about 2 days ago):** A magnitude 4.2 earthquake in central Taiwan, a ban on Chinese-owned yachts under revised entry rules, and Taiwan closing its office in Papua New Guinea.\n\nThe Taipei Times page snapshot is older, so treat its headline timing with some caution. For confirmed November 10 coverage, check Focus Taiwan or Taiwan News directly."],"durationSeconds":6.564809059000001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GyAFtVdkbhnyETAgZE9PcH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EMgsGKCAyH2ywDAfNZhgUV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"台灣 新聞 2026年11月10日\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"民視新聞網 - 24小時不間斷專業新聞服務\",\"url\":\"https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"即時新聞 - 中時新聞網\",\"url\":\"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS新聞網 - 最受信任的台灣新聞媒體\",\"url\":\"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"美股四大指數走揚助攻！台股開盤狂飆逾千點 強勢站穩4萬2 - 民視新聞網\",\"url\":\"https://ftvnews.com.tw/news/detail/2026B10W0152\"},{\"title\":\"ETtoday新聞雲\",\"url\":\"https://www.ettoday.net/\"},{\"title\":\"台股強彈逾1,300點重返4萬3！日月光、頎邦、矽格齊鎖漲停\",\"url\":\"https://udn.com/news/story/7251/9868281\"},{\"title\":\"中央社 CNA\",\"url\":\"https://www.cna.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"收盤／台積電大漲100元、聯發科漲停！領軍台股暴力反彈 狂飆1960點\",\"url\":\"https://setn.com/news/1935979\"},{\"title\":\"Next TV News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Next_TV_News\"}]\n\n今天(11/10)的台灣新聞搜尋結果以11月9日至10日的報導為主,要點如下:\n\n- **股市:** 台股開盤大漲,民視報導台股10日開盤上漲468.63點,一度衝上4萬2點關卡。 台股今（10）日開盤上漲468.63點、以42,130.33點開出，迅速衝上4萬2關卡。前一日的漲勢也很強,台股今（9）日強勢反彈，終場大漲1960.06點。\n- **國家安全:** 中央社早盤快訊提到,國軍偵測到共艦與共機擾台,並已嚴密監控。\n- **政治:** 2026年九合一選舉進入競選階段,各陣營密集站台、輔選。\n- **天氣:** 入秋後北部夜間變涼,中央社預報10日清晨平地低溫約15度。\n- **社會:** 民視、TVBS等媒體報導基隆一起死亡車禍,以及宜蘭一起兩車相撞起火事故。\n\n另外,輝達執行長黃仁勳婚外情的新聞在多家媒體都是焦點,也牽動了台股與科技股走勢。\n\n注意事項:搜尋結果並未精準對應「2026年11月10日」的日期篩選,部分頁面是舊的快取內容(例如標示為數個月前的首頁),因此以上內容主要取自9日至10日的報導,其他項目建議再點入來源確認。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"061d46d9-42a6-4a7e-8b4e-8c2c6f16682f","uuid":"09b730b9-e2b3-4f8a-b0df-eb21bb13b974","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:57:31.798Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"台灣 新聞 2026年11月10日","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019NCAbcVvPhS9MBxgA8QXbP","content":[{"title":"民視新聞網 - 24小時不間斷專業新聞服務","url":"https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/"},{"title":"即時新聞 - 中時新聞網","url":"https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/"},{"title":"TVBS新聞網 - 最受信任的台灣